  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Ash Of Sin：自訂反座位實體</strong></h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/981547/description_a4dde722-ccc5-4a57-8110-79b41a11413e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>設定檔會產生在&nbsp;<code>config\\ash_of_sin\\</code>&nbsp;目錄中。</p>\n<p>設定檔的名稱為 custom_anti_seat_entity.toml。</p>\n<p>設定檔中的實體若處於坐下狀態，將導致所坐的方塊或實體遭到移除。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
